# Node
node_modules/

# NOTE: css/app.css is intentionally COMMITTED.
#
# Vercel has no build step for this project, so the compiled stylesheet must
# live in the repo. Run `npm run build:css` and commit the result whenever you
# edit src/input.css or add/remove classes in the HTML.
# `npm run css:check` fails if it is stale.

